license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
abstract: >-
  Proposes a two-clock demand-capacity-functional-engagement temporal interface for
  evidence-qualified whole-person state understanding and conditional future
  forecasts, with explicit prior-art comparison and a prospective falsifiable
  validation protocol. It reports no new independent longitudinal predictive
  results or intervention effects.
